This repository contains the LUNA modpack build tools and the LUNA UI theme
(scripts, generated textures, title screen panorama, logo, icon and splash texts).
The source is published so that anyone can read and verify it, but no license is
granted to copy, modify or redistribute it outside of the LUNA modpack without
written permission.

Third-party mods, resource packs and shaders referenced by the modpack are NOT part
of this repository: they are downloaded from their official Modrinth pages and
remain the property of their respective authors, under their own licenses.
